{"slug":"factory-profiles","round":1,"verdict":"PASS","escalate":false,"assertions":[{"id":"A1","status":"green","proof":"projects/wahub/{project.json,critical-files.json,seat.env,validation.md} exist; templates/external-seat.env absent (git mv)"},{"id":"A2","status":"green","proof":"project-resolver.test.mjs + probe: profile block = gate[5], criticalFiles[12], abs seatEnvPath/validationPath"},{"id":"A3","status":"green","proof":"validator probed unknown id, corrupt project.json, corrupt critical-files.json, missing projects/ dir — all yield defaults, none throw"},{"id":"A4","status":"green","proof":"resolveProject({project:'totally-unknown-xyz'}).id === 'totally-unknown-xyz' — no product-literal fallback"},{"id":"A5","status":"green","proof":"cage-settings.mjs print --project wahub: 24/24 Edit+Write rules for the 12 globs; auditCageSettings() === []"},{"id":"A6","status":"green","proof":"base template deny = 11 generic rules, zero product paths (cage-settings.test.mjs)"},{"id":"A7","status":"green","proof":"no wholesale .claude/** deny; 0 mis-anchored rules; 0 unsubstituted placeholders; 2 self-protect rules; pre-existing invariants unmodified"},{"id":"A8","status":"green","proof":"project-profile.test.mjs iterates every profile; validator mutation-tested empty gate[] and a planted sk- secret — both go red. Guard test pins >=1 profile so an empty loop cannot pass."},{"id":"A9","status":"green","proof":"grep -rn wahub scripts/ templates/ skills/ (excl *.test.mjs) = 0 hits; meta test goes red with file:line when a literal is planted in a script, a template, or a SKILL.md"},{"id":"A10","status":"green","proof":"dispatch resolves projects/wahub/seat.env when FACTORY_ROOT is the v2.2 tree, and falls back to templates/external-seat.env on a stale checkout; probe-secrets against the real wahub .env: 0 of 26 parent secrets leaked"},{"id":"A11p","status":"green","proof":"Amendment 1: /scrumban/ redirects to '/' for any manifest; two-entry ordering test asserts neither entry claims the legacy URL. Validator judged the amendment a STRENGTHENING (behavior corrected), not a weakening."},{"id":"A12","status":"green","proof":"348 -> 384 tests. Validator accounted for all 5 removed test( lines: 4 reworded redirect tests + 1 wahub-critical-files assertion re-homed to conformance Part 1 test 5. Zero silent deletions."}],"notes":"Held-out validator (fresh seat, contract + diff only, instructed to refute). PASS on all 12. It found one defect the contract did NOT cover: probe-secrets loadDummyValues() read scripts/templates/external-seat.env — a path that has never existed at any commit — so the dummy-value subtraction was dead since written. Pre-existing, not mission-introduced (git ls-tree at the mission base shows the template at templates/, never under scripts/); the coordinator corrected the validator's attribution. Fixed in c79ae1f: the loader now resolves the active profile's seat.env; 4 loader + 3 CLI smoke tests, all verified RED against the historical dead loader before green. A main() typo (opts.project) had shipped through 381 green tests because the CLI had no test at all. Coordinator additionally found that adding the factory dogfood profile removes the sole-entry default, so engine commands now need --project; verdict.mjs now says so instead of only 'unknown mission slug'. Suite 384 tests / 380 pass / 0 fail / 4 skip; both new skips carry honest reasons.","ts":"2026-07-09T16:21:12.053Z"}
